achievement-merc-become-merc-name = Sword for Hire
achievement-merc-become-merc-desc = Enter as a mercenary. Your blade now has a price.

achievement-merc-armor-name = Ready for Battle
achievement-merc-armor-desc = Equip a leather or iron breastplate, steel boots, and steel gauntlets while playing as a mercenary.

achievement-merc-contract1-name = First Contract
achievement-merc-contract1-desc = Complete one contract while playing as a mercenary.

achievement-merc-zweihander-name = Two-Handed Argument
achievement-merc-zweihander-desc = Obtain a zweihander while playing as a mercenary.

achievement-merc-contract2-round-name = A Day's Work
achievement-merc-contract2-round-desc = In one round, complete two contracts and earn 300 revents while playing as a mercenary.

achievement-merc-become-leader-name = Mercenary Captain
achievement-merc-become-leader-desc = Enter as the mercenary leader. Now the contracts pass through your hands.

achievement-merc-office-letter-name = Access to the High Seats
achievement-merc-office-letter-desc = As the mercenary leader, enter one leader's office (jarl, legate, archmage, preacher, mine chief, elder, or chieftain) and obtain their letter.

achievement-merc-contract10-name = Master of Contracts
achievement-merc-contract10-desc = Complete ten contracts as the mercenary leader.

achievement-merc-2000-round-name = Golden Vein
achievement-merc-2000-round-desc = Earn 2000 revents in one round as the mercenary leader.
